        "identifier": "https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures/blob/main/FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/MovingSofa.lean",
        "note": "Google DeepMind's formal-conjectures states the optimality (solved) and the uniqueness (category research open, volume_eq_sofaConstant_iff_congruent_gerversSofa) with different definitions: moving sofas in EuclideanSpace R (Fin 2) moved from the identity, the optimal area as a supremum, and Gerver's sofa from Gerver's four constants. The Challenge restates its definitions and its four statements in the namespace FormalConjectures.MovingSofa, states three theorems relating its definitions to Baek's (namespace Bridge, proved in MovingSofaBridge/), and derives the four statements from Baek's theorems through them.",
